{'symbol': 'TJX', 'date': '2021-05-27 16:05:00', 'title': 'THE TJX COMPANIES, INC. REINSTATES SHARE REPURCHASE PROGRAM, ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND, AND UPDATES Q2 FY22 SALES TRENDS', 'text': 'FRAMINGHAM, MASS.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE TJX COMPANIES, INC. (NYSE:TJX) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS REINSTATED ITS SHARE REPURCHASE PROGRAM. THE COMPANY PLANS TO REPURCHASE APPROXIMATELY $1.0 BILLION TO $1.25 BILLION OF TJX STOCK DURING THE FISCAL YEAR ENDING JANUARY 29, 2022, AND CURRENTLY HAS APPROXIMATELY $3.0 BILLION REMAINING UNDER ITS EXISTING STOCK REPURCHASE PROGRAMS. TJX ALSO ANNOUNCED THE DECLARATION OF A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON ITS COMMON STOCK OF $.26 PER SHARE PAYA'}